{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29602","headline":"[安定]城楼 · 李商隐","name":"[安定]城楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"迢遰高城百尺楼，绿杨枝外尽汀洲。\n贾生年少虚垂泪，王粲春来更远游。\n永忆江湖归白发，欲回天地入扁舟。\n不知腐鼠成滋味，猜意鸳雏竟未休。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29602.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29602","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}